internal/oracle/testdata/enum_tag_refused/predicate_literal.a:13:30: Adamic 0.1 refuses an unproven predicate argument for parameter predicate (argument "isB"): the comparison of tag proves nothing about the layout, since a member whose tag is an open numeric enum can hold that value; pass a named function or arrow whose body proves both predicate branches; return a boolean and narrow at the caller (adamic/no-type-predicate)
